ns, and it will shoot into the sky with immense force. Don't worry, the bottle is made of high-toughness acrylic that will not break easily.\nAs for the soda inside... does anyone actually buy it for the soda?","abilities":["Flying unit.","Gradually accelerates when moving, but loses HP over time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":5000,"atk":350,"def":100,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"balloon":{"slug":"balloon","name":"Balloon","icon":"/enemies-icons/Balloon.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"One of the thousands of hot-air balloons that comprise the first levitating plate on Terra.\nKing Charles the Mad believed the only reason his castle would not move was because it did not have enough Originium engines. People never change, even after centuries.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Does not count towards the defeated enemies counter","Grants 1 Buoyancy when on a Levitatable Zone"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.5,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":0,"def":0,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1}},"flying_toaster":{"slug":"flying_toaster","name":"Flying Toaster","icon":"/enemies-icons/Flying Toaster.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A crisp beep, then fresh toast falls directly onto your plate.\nRestaurants that use it typically require customers to take off their hats. Not for good manners, but because it often mistakes hats for plates.","abilities":["Flying unit.","When not blocked, continuously deals splash damage to surrounding allied units"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":330,"def":300,"res":20,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"at